<sp who="#THE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Theodor</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Na, geigt er &#x017F;chon, der Herr Papa?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#CHR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Chri&#x017F;tine</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
