<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>O jeh, die fal&#x017F;che Per&#x017F;on.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#CHR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Chri&#x017F;tine</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Oh, die i&#x017F;t gewiß nicht fal&#x017F;ch, die i&#x017F;t &#x017F;ehr gut<lb/>
zu mir.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Du glaub&#x017F;t auch einer jeden.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#CHR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Chri&#x017F;tine</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Warum &#x017F;oll die denn gegen mich fal&#x017F;ch &#x017F;ein?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Fritz</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Wer i&#x017F;t denn die Kathrin?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
