<pb n="39" facs="#f0045"/>
<sp who="#CHR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Chri&#x017F;tine</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Nein.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Das mußt Du Dir an&#x017F;chau&#x2019;n. Fe&#x017F;ch! ..</p> <stage>(Sie<lb/>
