<sp who="#FRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Fritz</hi></speaker> <stage>(lacht).</stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Was i&#x017F;t denn? Wir möchten auch was hören!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#THE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Theodor</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
