<pb n="43" facs="#f0049"/>
<sp who="#CHR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Chri&#x017F;tine</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Gott, i&#x017F;t das Mädel ausgela&#x017F;&#x017F;en!</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#THE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Theodor</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Na, nicht in die Teller ....</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Fritz</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Wo will&#x017F;t Du &#x017F;itzen, Chri&#x017F;tin&#x2019;?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#THE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Theodor</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Wo i&#x017F;t denn ein Stoppelzieher?</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Fritz</hi></speaker><lb/>
