<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi></speaker> <stage>(ver&#x017F;ucht den Wein aufzumachen).</stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#FRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Fritz</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
