<sp who="#THE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Theodor</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p>Da i&#x017F;t doch kein Wort wahr.</p></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#MIZ"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Mizi</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
