<sp who="#FRI"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Fritz</hi></speaker> <stage>(&#x017F;chenkt den Wein ein.)</stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#THE"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Theodor</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
