<sp who="#CHR"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Chri&#x017F;tine</hi></speaker> <stage>(Blick).</stage></sp><lb/>
<sp who="#KAT"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Katharina</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
